WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.280
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.190
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.940
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.640
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.730
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.100
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:43.040
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:49.280
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:56.550
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:03.300
What is truly precious?

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.300
I activate Dark-Eyes Magic!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.490
Dark Magician!

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.700
I also play Jigen Bakudan!

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:40.750
Jigen Bakudan will destroy Relinquished in two turns.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:44.580
Along with your monsters, Yugi boy.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:48.320
I don't have a card in my hand that will let me make a comeback.

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:51.830
And Pegasus knows everything anyway.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.860
I can only draw a card.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:02:00.630
But Pegasus's Millennium Eye will let him see what card I've drawn.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.160
What can I do?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:09.070
As long as I can Mind Scan, there's nothing you can do.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:15.080
Union of Light and Dark
Black Chaos Descends

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.080
Yugi...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.330
Damn!  What can we do?

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.660
Yugi, are you okay?

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:30.860
Answer me!

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.540
Answer us please!

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.560
Yugi...

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.050
Grandpa!

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:55.550
Other than your cards, there's one other thing that you trust.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.060
What I trust?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.060
Your other self isn't the only person inside your heart.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.460
Your friends are also there, connected by an unseen bond.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.570
I understand, Grandpa!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:16.860
Yugi...

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.580
Jonouchi!  Honda!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:25.080
Do you remember when the four of us made a ring of friendship?

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.150
Yeah!

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.490
Of course!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.240
Yugi and our hearts are united as one!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:37.780
That's right.  Even if we're apart, our hearts are still united.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:42.500
The power of the shadows can't break our bond of friendship!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.000
Yugi!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.200
Don't lose, Yugi!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.100
Yugi, we're with you.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:59.220
Our hearts are united in a bond of friendship!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.730
I'll draw a card!

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.060
Mind Scan!

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.900
It's pointless to resist, Yugi boy.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:23.910
You cannot hide the identity of the card in your mind from me.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.640
What?

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:32.100
There are other minds inside Yugi boy's mind!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.650
I can't see the card!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.320
How can this be?

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:38.540
Whoever has the stronger mind will win the game.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:44.390
But if you're not playing, your mind cannot enter a Shadow Game!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:49.170
Pegasus, I won't let you enter Yugi's mind anymore!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.000
Get out of here!

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.460
Everyone!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.580
Pegasus, Yugi won't lose!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.820
He will defeat you.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.180
Prepare yourself, Pegasus!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.920
Thank you, everyone!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.820
Unbelievable!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:20.160
His friends' minds are repelling my Millennium Eye!

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:26.260
Even the power of your Millennium Eye can't break through our unity!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.020
Here I go, Pegasus!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:32.400
The spell card Mystic Box!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.480
Two boxes on the field?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.750
It's too late to counter!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:53.100
By switching places with Jigen Bakudan, Dark Magician escapes from Relinquished!

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:59.820
Relinquished absorbed Jigen Bakudan!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.000
Goddamn!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:09.000
I end my turn.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.980
My turn.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.470
Brain Control!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.960
What?  That card can brainwash!

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:39.460
Relinquished is under Yugi's control for one turn.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:54.190
You've caused your own defeat.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:07:00.930
Due to your actions, Dark Magician will be destroyed when Jigen Bakudan self-destructs!

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.330
Are you sure about that?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.880
I still have a set card.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:10.670
It's the card my other self left behind.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.200
Black Magic Ritual!

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:15.780
A Ritual Card?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:26.160
I tribute Jigen Bakudan and Dark Magician!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.530
This is how he's stopping the bomb?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:45.170
The dark and chaotic spellcaster Magician of Black Chaos descends!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.420
Magician of Black Chaos?

00:07:55.420 --> 00:08:02.780
My other self suffered injuries to leave me the card Black Magic Ritual.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:07.430
Light and shadow unite to create the inhabitant of chaos!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.680
The supreme and noble magician of magicians!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.170
Pegasus!

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:20.560
This is our trump card!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.160
We'll defeat you with our trump card!

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.100
Impressive, Yugi boy.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:33.250
But Relinquished's brainwashing ends this turn.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:40.430
On my next turn, Relinquished will absorb Black Chaos and steal its effects.

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:46.800
Yugi boy, your best isn't good enough to defeat me!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:51.600
Pegasus, my heart has a bond with my friends.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:56.900
Even the power of your Millennium Item can't break our united power!

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:04.050
This turn, I set one card.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.390
And I play another monster in defense position.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.460
I end my turn.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.420
Yugi boy played two set cards.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:25.480
I don't know what they are because his friends' minds are preventing me from seeing them.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.910
Shit!  They're such a nuisance!

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.980
My turn!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:41.220
Relinquished is no longer brainwashed, so it's my monster again.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:48.730
I'll use my trump card to show you that your friendship is meaningless.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:56.760
Relinquished's effect will absorb Black Chaos.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:02.480
But Yugi boy won't fall for the same trick twice.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:10.600
I'll play two cards and power up Relinquished's effect even more.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.660
I fuse Relinquished and Thousand-Eyes Idol together!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.980
The evil god Thousand-Eyes Restrict!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.440
Countless eyes cover its body!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:46.020
Yugi boy, the duels in the Kingdom will end this turn with your cruel defeat.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:12.960
Our bond of friendship must carry our wishes to Yugi!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:17.060
Don't lose against Pegasus or the power of the shadows!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.690
Yugi, you can't give up!

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:22.690
We're with you!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.940
You don't know how a match will end until it's over!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:46.400
Your Black Chaos can't stop my Thousand-Eyes Restrict's effect.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:50.950
Thousand-Eyes Restrict's effect?

00:11:52.170 --> 00:12:02.140
When Thousand-Eyes Restrict's eyes all open, all your monsters can't move.

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:12.720
Even though it's a Fusion Monster, it has no attack points.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:18.220
He will absorb Black Chaos and steal its effects.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.860
But I won't let that happen.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.980
I made a vow with my other self!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:29.920
Please let this last card I draw be something that can defeat Pegasus.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.060
Please!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:40.760
My other self, use this card to defeat Pegasus.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.940
I will defeat you using Black Chaos!

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:54.380
No matter what you try, you can't break our vow!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.590
Final turn!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.100
I'm counting on you, my monsters!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.870
Thousand-Eyes Restrict's effect!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.600
Thousand-Eyes Curse!

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.650
Black Chaos!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:34.530
Your monster can no longer move.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:40.660
Thousand-Eyes Curse also works on monsters that have yet to be played.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:45.060
In other words, you're caught in an eternal curse.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.400
Eternal curse?

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:57.110
Next, I'll activate Thousand-Eyes Restrict's Evil Eye to absorb your monster and steal its effects.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.720
It's over, Yugi boy.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.220
Evil Eye activates!

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.820
I flip over my spell card!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:23.380
Evil Eye's light absorbs Black Chaos into Thousand-Eyes Restrict!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.840
Are you sure about that?

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.880
What?  Kuriboh?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.980
You made a mistake.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:38.390
Thousand-Eyes Curse affected my set Kuriboh and flipped it faceup.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.120
When did he do that?

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:44.280
And my set card Multiply activates.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.630
Kuriboh multiplies infinitely!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:53.630
What?  The evil eye's light are shining on countless Kuribohs!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:15:00.370
Your evil eye's light affects all the Kuribohs, absorbing them into Thousand-Eyes Restrict.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:21.060
Countless Kuribohs have been absorbed into Thousand-Eyes Restrict!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.500
This is what I was aiming for.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:30.340
Due to Kuriboh's effect, it transforms into a mine when it touches the enemy and self-destructs.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.800
A mine?

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:51.140
Since Kuriboh was destroyed, I lose 300 life points.

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:56.560
However, Thousand-Eyes Restrict's thousand eyes are all destroyed!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.160
Oh no!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.300
Yugi boy was willing to sacrifice Kuriboh to do this!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:04.580
The curse on Black Chaos is now gone!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.040
I hope you're prepared, Pegasus.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.010
It's my turn.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.020
Black Chaos attacks!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:18.160
The spell of destruction, Death Ultima!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.360
Thousand-Eyes Restrict is destroyed!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:58.060
Pegasus, we win.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.070
I lost.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:18.380
I have the power of the Millennium Eye, but I lost in a game that I created.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.490
My other self.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.480
We did it, partner!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.100
Everyone shared their hearts with us.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.820
Yugi!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:07.930
Everyone!  Thank-

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:09.720
Don't say anything!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.520
Because I know.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.540
Yugi, when you were battling-

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:18.980
I felt your struggles in battle and your joy when you won.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.040
Yeah!  Me too!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:25.560
Though it was only a little bit, I felt that I was battling alongside you.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.380
Yeah!  That's what I was gonna say!

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:30.080
Yeah!  I was happy!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:34.280
Come on!  You're saying everything I want to say!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.600
What's wrong with that?

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:42.380
I guess you're right.  Because...

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:45.200
Yugi won!

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.470
All right!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.470
Thanks, everyone.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.570
Oh!  What about Pegasus?

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:55.320
We have to make him return Grandpa, Kaiba and Mokuba back to normal.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.580
That's right.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.810
We'll make him keep his promise.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.320
Pegasus is gone!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:08.160
Where did he go?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.280
That coward!  Let's go find him!

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.830
But we can't abandon Bakura and Mokuba.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.760
Hey!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.330
Everybody!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.330
Bakura!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.840
Are you back to normal?

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.880
Huh?  What are you talking about?

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.940
When I woke up, I was laying here.

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:30.720
You really don't remember anything?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:35.550
That weird ring around your neck seemed to have been controlling you, Bakura.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.550
Really?

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.650
Millennium Ring?

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.340
Where is the Ring now?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.720
It creeped me out, so I threw it away.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.960
Thank you.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.390
You saved me, Honda.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:56.500
Bakura, can you watch Mokuba for us?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.500
I guess so.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.360
Okay, let's go find Pegasus.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.840
Hooray!  Yugi won!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.760
But we have to find the missing Pegasus.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.760
What?  Someone attacked Pegasus?

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:48.400
Will Grandpa's soul return to us?

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:54.360
The secrets of the Millennium Eye and Pegasus's unexpected past are written in a journal in his room.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:57.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
King of Duelists

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.640
Duel, standby!

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:13.320
The flask glistens

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:21.170
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:30.140
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:37.920
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:43.750
Shower of happiness

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:47.860
I will shower you with it

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:56.140
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:56.340 --> 00:22:00.370
Shower of happiness

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:04.500
You are not alone

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:11.220
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
